    "detailed_description": "This is an adventure game, in addition to providing a scene of exploration, the game to do a lot of things rely on the roll of 20-sided dice, known as &quot;Play Chess&quot; in the game.<br />\r\nIf the number of dice is greater than or equal to the number of dice on the other side, the game succeeds, otherwise the game fails.<br />\r\nIf you fail to roll a 20-sided die, don't worry. If you roll the dice again, &quot;Luck will favor the lucky one.&quot;<br />\r\nIn the game, you can invite other characters to join the team. Of course, the &quot;invitation&quot; still depends on the result of rolling a 20-sided die.<br />\r\nIn a game, the character who is first in line affects the outcome of the game. A game is more successful when a particular character is at the top of the line. However, we want to emphasize that everything is not absolute, there is always a certain possibility, but the success rate does vary.<br />\r\nAs the story progresses, we often find some unusual places, waiting to be discovered in the distance.",
    "about_the_game": "This is an adventure game, in addition to providing a scene of exploration, the game to do a lot of things rely on the roll of 20-sided dice, known as &quot;Play Chess&quot; in the game.<br />\r\nIf the number of dice is greater than or equal to the number of dice on the other side, the game succeeds, otherwise the game fails.<br />\r\nIf you fail to roll a 20-sided die, don't worry. If you roll the dice again, &quot;Luck will favor the lucky one.&quot;<br />\r\nIn the game, you can invite other characters to join the team. Of course, the &quot;invitation&quot; still depends on the result of rolling a 20-sided die.<br />\r\nIn a game, the character who is first in line affects the outcome of the game. A game is more successful when a particular character is at the top of the line. However, we want to emphasize that everything is not absolute, there is always a certain possibility, but the success rate does vary.<br />\r\nAs the story progresses, we often find some unusual places, waiting to be discovered in the distance.",
    "short_description": "A adventure game. Wayfarer Team, received the princess of the Land of Music invitation, set foot on an unknown adventure.",
